<p data-imt-p=3D"1">In the following steps, we configure ANTSDR=E2=80=99s E=
thernet interface to use a static IP address, so that it will get the same =
IP address every time it is powered on, making it easier to access the devi=
ce in <strong>GNU Radio</strong> or <strong>libiio</strong> on the host com=
puter.<font class=3D"notranslate immersive-translate-target-wrapper" lang=
=3D"zh-CN" data-imt-deferred-display=3D"" style=3D"display: none;"><br><fon=
t class=3D"notranslate immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-none im=
mersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper-theme-none immersive-tra=
nslate-target-translation-block-wrapper" data-immersive-translate-translati=
on-element-mark=3D"1"><font class=3D"notranslate immersive-translate-target=
-inner immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-none-inner" data-immers=
ive-translate-translation-element-mark=3D"1">=E6=8E=A5=E4=B8=8B=E6=9D=A5=EF=
=BC=8C=E6=88=91=E4=BB=AC=E5=B0=86 ANTSDR =E7=9A=84=E4=BB=A5=E5=A4=AA=E7=BD=
=91=E6=8E=A5=E5=8F=A3=E9=85=8D=E7=BD=AE=E4=B8=BA=E4=BD=BF=E7=94=A8=E9=9D=99=
=E6=80=81 IP =E5=9C=B0=E5=9D=80=EF=BC=8C=E4=BB=A5=E4=BE=BF=E6=AF=8F=E6=AC=
=A1=E5=BC=80=E6=9C=BA=E6=97=B6=E9=83=BD=E8=83=BD=E8=8E=B7=E5=BE=97=E7=9B=B8=
=E5=90=8C=E7=9A=84 IP =E5=9C=B0=E5=9D=80=EF=BC=8C=E4=BB=8E=E8=80=8C=E6=9B=
=B4=E5=AE=B9=E6=98=93=E5=9C=A8=E4=B8=BB=E6=9C=BA=E4=B8=8A=E7=9A=84 <strong>=
GNU Radio</strong> =E6=88=96 <strong>libiio</strong> =E4=B8=AD=E8=AE=BF=E9=
=97=AE=E8=AF=A5=E8=AE=BE=E5=A4=87=E3=80=82</font></font></font></p>
<p data-imt-p=3D"1">First open the <code class=3D"docutils literal notransl=
ate"><span class=3D"pre">/etc/network/interfaces</span></code> file.<font c=
lass=3D"notranslate immersive-translate-target-wrapper" lang=3D"zh-CN" data=
-imt-deferred-display=3D"" style=3D"display: none;"><br><font class=3D"notr=
anslate immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-none immersive-transla=
te-target-translation-block-wrapper-theme-none immersive-translate-target-t=
ranslation-block-wrapper" data-immersive-translate-translation-element-mark=
=3D"1"><font class=3D"notranslate immersive-translate-target-inner immersiv=
e-translate-target-translation-theme-none-inner" data-immersive-translate-t=
ranslation-element-mark=3D"1">=E9=A6=96=E5=85=88=E6=89=93=E5=BC=80 <code cl=
ass=3D"docutils literal notranslate"><span class=3D"pre">/etc/network/inter=
faces</span></code> =E6=96=87=E4=BB=B6=E3=80=82</font></font></font></p>
<div class=3D"highlight-default notranslate"><div class=3D"highlight"><pre>=
<span></span><span class=3D"n">vi</span> <span class=3D"o">/</span><span cl=
ass=3D"n">etc</span><span class=3D"o">/</span><span class=3D"n">network</sp=
an><span class=3D"o">/</span><span class=3D"n">interfaces</span>
</pre></div>
</div>
<p data-imt-p=3D"1">Then, add the following configuration to assign a stati=
c IP of <code class=3D"docutils literal notranslate"><span class=3D"pre">19=
2.168.1.10</span></code><font class=3D"notranslate immersive-translate-targ=
et-wrapper" lang=3D"zh-CN" data-imt-deferred-display=3D"" style=3D"display:=
 none;"><br><font class=3D"notranslate immersive-translate-target-translati=
on-theme-none immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper-theme-no=
ne immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper" data-immersive-tra=
nslate-translation-element-mark=3D"1"><font class=3D"notranslate immersive-=
translate-target-inner immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-none-in=
ner" data-immersive-translate-translation-element-mark=3D"1">=E7=84=B6=E5=
=90=8E=EF=BC=8C=E6=B7=BB=E5=8A=A0=E4=BB=A5=E4=B8=8B=E9=85=8D=E7=BD=AE=E4=BB=
=A5=E5=88=86=E9=85=8D=E9=9D=99=E6=80=81 IP =E5=9C=B0=E5=9D=80 <code class=
=3D"docutils literal notranslate"><span class=3D"pre">192.168.1.10</span></=
code></font></font></font></p>
<div class=3D"highlight-default notranslate"><div class=3D"highlight"><pre>=
<span></span><span class=3D"n">auto</span> <span class=3D"n">eth0</span>
<span class=3D"n">iface</span> <span class=3D"n">eth0</span> <span class=3D=
"n">inet</span> <span class=3D"n">static</span>
<span class=3D"n">address</span> <span class=3D"mf">192.168.1.10</span>
<span class=3D"n">netmask</span> <span class=3D"mf">255.255.255.0</span>
<span class=3D"n">gateway</span> <span class=3D"mf">192.168.1.1</span>
</pre></div>
</div>
<p data-imt-p=3D"1">After saving the file, restart ANTSDR using the <code c=
lass=3D"docutils literal notranslate"><span class=3D"pre">reboot</span></co=
de> command.<font class=3D"notranslate immersive-translate-target-wrapper" =
lang=3D"zh-CN" data-imt-deferred-display=3D"" style=3D"display: none;"><br>=
<font class=3D"notranslate immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-non=
e immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper-theme-none immersive=
-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper" data-immersive-translate-trans=
lation-element-mark=3D"1"><font class=3D"notranslate immersive-translate-ta=
rget-inner immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-none-inner" data-im=
mersive-translate-translation-element-mark=3D"1">=E4=BF=9D=E5=AD=98=E6=96=
=87=E4=BB=B6=E5=90=8E=EF=BC=8C=E4=BD=BF=E7=94=A8 <code class=3D"docutils li=
teral notranslate"><span class=3D"pre">reboot</span></code> =E5=91=BD=E4=BB=
=A4=E9=87=8D=E5=90=AF ANTSDR=E3=80=82</font></font></font></p>
<p data-imt-p=3D"1">Therefore, when using <strong>libiio</strong> to access=
 the device, you only need to set the address. Here, the IP address of the =
network port connected to ANTSDR on the user=E2=80=99s Linux host must be i=
n the same network segment as ANTSDR. For example, if your host computer ha=
s the IP address <code class=3D"docutils literal notranslate"><span class=
=3D"pre">192.168.1.100</span></code> then we can use libiio to test the con=
nection.<font class=3D"notranslate immersive-translate-target-wrapper" lang=
=3D"zh-CN" data-imt-deferred-display=3D"" style=3D"display: none;"><br><fon=
t class=3D"notranslate immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-none im=
mersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper-theme-none immersive-tra=
nslate-target-translation-block-wrapper" data-immersive-translate-translati=
on-element-mark=3D"1"><font class=3D"notranslate immersive-translate-target=
-inner immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-none-inner" data-immers=
ive-translate-translation-element-mark=3D"1">=E5=9B=A0=E6=AD=A4=EF=BC=8C=E4=
=BD=BF=E7=94=A8 <strong>libiio</strong> =E8=AE=BF=E9=97=AE=E8=AE=BE=E5=A4=
=87=E6=97=B6=EF=BC=8C=E5=8F=AA=E9=9C=80=E8=AE=BE=E7=BD=AE=E5=9C=B0=E5=9D=80=
=E5=8D=B3=E5=8F=AF=E3=80=82=E8=BF=99=E9=87=8C=EF=BC=8C=E7=94=A8=E6=88=B7 Li=
nux =E4=B8=BB=E6=9C=BA=E4=B8=8A=E8=BF=9E=E6=8E=A5=E5=88=B0 ANTSDR =E7=9A=84=
=E7=BD=91=E7=BB=9C=E7=AB=AF=E5=8F=A3=E7=9A=84 IP =E5=9C=B0=E5=9D=80=E5=BF=
=85=E9=A1=BB=E4=B8=8E ANTSDR =E4=BD=8D=E4=BA=8E=E5=90=8C=E4=B8=80=E7=BD=91=
=E6=AE=B5=E3=80=82=E4=BE=8B=E5=A6=82=EF=BC=8C=E5=A6=82=E6=9E=9C=E6=82=A8=E7=
=9A=84=E4=B8=BB=E6=9C=BA IP =E5=9C=B0=E5=9D=80=E4=B8=BA <code class=3D"docu=
tils literal notranslate"><span class=3D"pre">192.168.1.100</span></code> =
=EF=BC=8C=E5=88=99=E5=8F=AF=E4=BB=A5=E4=BD=BF=E7=94=A8 libiio =E6=B5=8B=E8=
=AF=95=E8=BF=9E=E6=8E=A5=E3=80=82</font></font></font></p>
<p data-imt-p=3D"1">If <strong>libiio</strong> is not already installed on =
your system, please install it first.<font class=3D"notranslate immersive-t=
ranslate-target-wrapper" lang=3D"zh-CN" data-imt-deferred-display=3D"" styl=
e=3D"display: none;"><br><font class=3D"notranslate immersive-translate-tar=
get-translation-theme-none immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wra=
pper-theme-none immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper" data-=
immersive-translate-translation-element-mark=3D"1"><font class=3D"notransla=
te immersive-translate-target-inner immersive-translate-target-translation-=
theme-none-inner" data-immersive-translate-translation-element-mark=3D"1">=
=E5=A6=82=E6=9E=9C=E6=82=A8=E7=9A=84=E7=B3=BB=E7=BB=9F=E4=B8=8A=E5=B0=9A=E6=
=9C=AA=E5=AE=89=E8=A3=85 <strong>libiio</strong> =EF=BC=8C=E8=AF=B7=E5=85=
=88=E5=AE=89=E8=A3=85=E5=AE=83=E3=80=82</font></font></font></p>
<p data-imt-p=3D"1">You can refer to this link to install <strong><a class=
=3D"reference external" href=3D"https://wiki.analog.com/resources/eval/user=
-guides/ad-fmcdaq2-ebz/software/linux/applications/libiio#:~:text=3Dlibiio%=
20is%20a%20library%20that%20has%20been%20developed,of%20software%20interfac=
ing%20Linux%20Industrial%20I%2FO%20%28IIO%29%20devices.">libiio</a></strong=
></p>
<p data-imt-p=3D"1">or</p>
<p data-imt-p=3D"1">You can find detailed steps for installing <strong>libi=
io</strong> in <a class=3D"reference external" href=3D"https://antsdr-docs.=
microphase.cn/en/latest/device_and_usage_manual/ANTSDR_E_Series_Module/ANTS=
DR_E310_Reference_Manual/AntsdrE310_gnurdio.html">ANTSDR E310 Gnuradio</a><=
/p>
<p data-imt-p=3D"1">If you successfully installed <strong>libiio</strong>, =
execute <code class=3D"docutils literal notranslate"><span class=3D"pre">ii=
o_info</span> <span class=3D"pre">-s</span></code></p>
<p><img alt=3D"e310" src=3D"https://antsdr-docs.microphase.cn/en/latest/_im=
ages/fmcomms_iio_info.png" width=3D"696.4375" height=3D"269.40625"></p>
<p data-imt-p=3D"1">If you want to use the <strong>FMCOMMS</strong> firmwar=
e with <strong>GNU Radio</strong> and connect to ANTSDR, have a look at <st=
rong><a class=3D"reference external" href=3D"https://antsdr-docs.microphase=
.cn/en/latest/device_and_usage_manual/ANTSDR_E_Series_Module/ANTSDR_E310_Re=
ference_Manual/AntsdrE310_gnurdio.html">ANTSDR FMCOMMS</a></strong></p>
